{"about":["Marvel vs. Capcom Fighting Collection: Arcade Classics is a 2024 fighting game compilation developed and published by Capcom.","It includes Marvel Super Heroes (1995), Marvel vs. Capcom: Clash of Super Heroes (1998), and Marvel vs. Capcom 2: New Age of Heroes (2000), marking the first time these titles became available on new platforms since the seventh generation of video game consoles, as well as the first faithful console port of the beat 'em up title The Punisher (1993) and the first new console versions for X-Men: Children of the Atom (1994), X-Men vs. Street Fighter (1996), and Marvel Super Heroes vs. Street Fighter (1997) since their initial console releases."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202406/1406/8df9cb38ce39504568fd55f17171805b21fc3e95fd221b53.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202406/1406/8df9cb38ce39504568fd55f17171805b21fc3e95fd221b53.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202406/1406/edbc8abc0250975399c7956b259d224079633caa78d4d35f.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202406/1406/edbc8abc0250975399c7956b259d224079633caa78d4d35f.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202406/1406/c826004ad9cafd8b8d70b5e09e1c76b843892cb5879be069.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202406/1406/c826004ad9cafd8b8d70b5e09e1c76b843892cb5879be069.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202406/1406/fd6a207bfb86bc18d827e5d21b441b74732290d9f2d9d6a1.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202406/1406/fd6a207bfb86bc18d827e5d21b441b74732290d9f2d9d6a1.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202406/1406/f659fbeed843e9969ad49196817765a6a91cc34725115104.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.pla